"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">index</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">element</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    // 高优先级元素先出现</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> priority</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> parseInt</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(element.dataset.priority) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">||</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> index </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0.05</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> +</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> -</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> priority) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0.15</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">});</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"framer-motion-的-staggerchildren\">Framer Motion 的 staggerChildren</h2><p>在 Framer Motion 中，<code>staggerChildren</code> 在 <code>transition</code> 对象中配置：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"tsx\" data-code=\"const containerVariants = {&#10;  hidden: { opacity: 0 },&#10;  visible: {&#10;    opacity: 1,&#10;    transition: {&#10;      staggerChildren: 0.08, // 每个子元素间隔 0.08s&#10;      delayChildren: 0.2, // 所有子元素整体延迟 0.2s&#10;      when: &#39;beforeChildren&#39;, // 父容器先完成，再开始子元素&#10;    },&#10;  },&#10;};&#10;&#10;// staggerChildren 配合 when&#10;const modalVariants = {&#10;  hidden: { scale: 0.9, opacity: 0 },&#10;  visible: {&#10;    scale: 1,&#10;    opacity: 1,&#10;    transition: {&#10;      staggerChildren: 0.05,&#10;      when: &#39;afterChildren&#39;, // 父容器等子元素完成后再运动（退场用）&#10;    },&#10;  },&#10;};\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>const containerVariants = {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  hidden: { opacity: 0 },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  visible: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    opacity: 1,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    transition: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      staggerChildren: 0.08, // 每个子元素间隔 0.08s</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      delayChildren: 0.2, // 所有子元素整体延迟 0.2s</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      when: 'beforeChildren', // 父容器先完成，再开始子元素</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>};</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// staggerChildren 配合 when</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const modalVariants = {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  hidden: { scale: 0.9, opacity: 0 },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  visible: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    scale: 1,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    opacity: 1,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    transition: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      staggerChildren: 0.05,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      when: 'afterChildren', // 父容器等子元素完成后再运动（退场用）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>};</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"delay-计算与时长控制\">delay 计算与时长控制</h2><h3 id=\"总时长估算公式\">总时长估算公式</h3><p>对于一组 N 个元素的 stagger 序列：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"总时长 = 单元素动画时长 + (N - 1) × stagger 间隔\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>总时长 = 单元素动画时长 + (N - 1) × stagger 间隔</span></span></code></pre></div><p>例：30 个元素，每个动画 0.4s，stagger 0.04s：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"总时长 = 0.4 + (30 - 1) × 0.04 = 0.4 + 1.16 = 1.56s\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>总时长 = 0.4 + (30 - 1) × 0.04 = 0.4 + 1.16 = 1.56s</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>控制总时长的策略</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"javascript\" data-code=\"// 方案一：指定总时长，让 GSAP 自动计算每元素间隔&#10;gsap.from(&#39;.item&#39;, {&#10;  y: 20,&#10;  opacity: 0,&#10;  duration: 0.4,&#10;  stagger: {&#10;    each: 0.05,&#10;    // 限制：N * each 不超过 0.8s&#10;    // 如果元素太多，可以动态计算&#10;  },&#10;});&#10;&#10;// 方案二：动态计算以控制总时长&#10;function calculateStagger(elementCount, maxTotalDuration, animDuration) {&#10;  const maxStagger = (maxTotalDuration - animDuration) / Math.max(elementCount - 1, 1);&#10;  return Math.min(maxStagger, 0.1); // 不超过 0.1s/元素&#10;}&#10;&#10;const items = document.querySelectorAll(&#39;.item&#39;);&#10;gsap.from(items, {&#10;  y: 20,&#10;  opacity: 0,&#10;  duration: 0.4,&#10;  stagger: calculateStagger(items.length, 0.8, 0.4),&#10;});\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 方案一：指定总时长，让 GSAP 自动计算每元素间隔</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">gsap.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'.item'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  y: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">20</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  opacity: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  duration: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.4</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  stagger: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    each: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.05</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    // 限制：N * each 不超过 0.8s</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    // 如果元素太多，可以动态计算</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">});</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 方案二：动态计算以控制总时长</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> calculateStagger</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">elementCount</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">maxTotalDuration</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">animDuration</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> maxStagger</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (maxTotalDuration </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> animDuration) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Math.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">max</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(elementCount </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Math.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">min</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(maxStagger, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">); </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 不超过 0.1s/元素</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> items</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> document.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">querySelectorAll</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'.item'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">gsap.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(items, {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  y: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">20</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  opacity: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  duration: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.4</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  stagger: </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">calculateStagger</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(items.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">length</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.8</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.4</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">});</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>Timeline（GSAP）</strong>：将多个补间组织成有序序列；时间定位支持顺序/相对偏移/绝对时间/标签四种方式</li>\n<li><strong>stagger</strong>：批量元素的交错延迟；<code>each</code> 指定间隔，<code>from</code> 控制扩散方向，<code>grid</code> 支持二维网格布局</li>\n<li><strong>staggerChildren（Framer Motion）</strong>：variants 中的交错配置，每个子元素的动画延迟 = 索引 × staggerChildren</li>\n<li><strong>总时长公式</strong>：<code>总时长 = 单元素动画时长 + (N-1) × stagger 间隔</code>；元素增多时需缩短间隔以控制总时长</li>\n<li><strong>视觉层次原则</strong>：主要内容先出现，次要内容随后，整体序列在 600-800ms 内完成</li>\n<li><strong>addLabel</strong>：GSAP Timeline 的语义化时间点，将相关动画组绑定到命名阶段，提升编排可读性</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>动画编排的核心是用时序表达视觉层次。GSAP Timeline 的标签系统和嵌套功能支持模块化组织复杂序列；stagger 的 <code>from</code> 参数和 <code>grid</code> 配置可以创造不同方向感的交错效果；总时长应控制在 600-800ms 以内，避免让用户等待。</p>\n<h2 id=\"本章导航\">本章导航</h2><ul>\n<li>上一篇：<a href=\"animation-performance\">动画性能优化</a> — jank 诊断与合成层管理</li>\n<li>下一篇：<a href=\"accessibility-reduced-motion\">无障碍与动效偏好</a> — prefers-reduced-motion</li>\n<li>章节概览：<a href=\"../performance/\">性能与模式</a></li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"编排与交错：时间轴设计、stagger 算法与 delay 计算","id":"编排与交错-时间轴设计-stagger-算法与-delay-计算"},{"level":2,"text":"动画编排的设计原则","id":"动画编排的设计原则"},{"level":2,"text":"GSAP Timeline 高级编排模式","id":"gsap-timeline-高级编排模式"},{"level":3,"text":"时间定位语法","id":"时间定位语法"},{"level":3,"text":"动态 Timeline：循环与条件","id":"动态-timeline-循环与条件"},{"level":2,"text":"stagger 算法详解","id":"stagger-算法详解"},{"level":3,"text":"基础 stagger：均匀间隔","id":"基础-stagger-均匀间隔"},{"level":3,"text":"空间感 stagger：from 参数","id":"空间感-stagger-from-参数"},{"level":3,"text":"自定义 stagger 函数","id":"自定义-stagger-函数"},{"level":2,"text":"Framer Motion 的 staggerChildren","id":"framer-motion-的-staggerchildren"},{"level":2,"text":"delay 计算与时长控制","id":"delay-计算与时长控制"},{"level":3,"text":"总时长估算公式","id":"总时长估算公式"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"本章导航","id":"本章导航"}],"prev":{"title":"动画性能优化：jank 诊断、合成层管理与 GPU 预算","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/web-animation-engineering/performance/animation-performance"},"next":{"title":"无障碍与动效偏好：prefers-reduced-motion 与前庭障碍保护","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/web-animation-engineering/performance/accessibility-reduced-motion"}}